14. Novelty paper ini sebenarnya cukup bagus — tetapi harus diposisikan ulang

Ini sangat penting.

JISA sudah memiliki paper tentang inter-dataset generalization. Misalnya paper D'Hooge et al. menunjukkan bahwa supervised IDS dapat mengalami penurunan besar ketika diuji pada dataset lain.

JISA juga sudah menerbitkan paper Layeghy et al. yang secara langsung menunjukkan perbedaan distribusi synthetic dan real-world NIDS datasets.

Jadi Anda tidak boleh menjual novelty sebagai:

"We show that NIDS does not generalize across datasets."

Itu sudah established.

Novelty Anda harus menjadi:

A controlled, deployment-oriented methodology that jointly addresses cross-extractor semantic incompatibility, diagnoses cross-network distribution shift, and evaluates low-label adaptation from synthetic benchmarks to real cloud traffic.

Ini jauh lebih kuat.

Dengan kata lain:

Paper lama:

"Cross-dataset generalization fails."

Paper Anda:

"Here is how to construct a comparable feature space, diagnose why the failure occurs, and repair it at low labeling cost—and we test the recipe on real cloud traffic."

Itulah positioning yang saya rekomendasikan.

15. Saya ingin contribution statement Anda diubah

Saat ini kontribusi Anda sudah bagus tetapi masih agak terlalu banyak.

Saya akan menyederhanakannya menjadi 3 kontribusi utama.

Contribution 1 — Semantic interoperability

A statistically audited semantic feature mapping procedure that identifies comparable flow-level features across heterogeneous extraction tools and explicitly rejects apparently equivalent features whose numerical semantics are incompatible.

Contribution 2 — Diagnosis and adaptation

A controlled cross-domain experimental framework that separates representation compatibility from distribution shift and quantifies the effectiveness of low-label target calibration and cross-domain augmentation.

Contribution 3 — Real-world validation

An end-to-end validation on real AWS traffic demonstrating the failure of zero-shot transfer and the recovery achievable through limited target-domain calibration.

Ini lebih tajam.

