29. Kesimpulan reviewer saya

Kalau saya menulis confidential comments to the editor, kira-kira penilaian saya:

The manuscript addresses a highly relevant problem for practical network intrusion detection: the lack of cross-network generalization of ML-based NIDS. Its combination of semantic feature auditing, controlled cross-dataset evaluation, low-label adaptation, and real AWS traffic validation provides potentially valuable practical and methodological contributions. The experimental scope is substantial and the negative results are transparently reported. However, several central claims currently exceed the supporting evidence, particularly the interpretation of the Ben-David domain-adaptation bound, the equivalence between Wasserstein distance and HΔH divergence, and the characterization of the proposed mixup procedure as label-free. The real-traffic evaluation also requires stronger controls against temporal/episode leakage and more robust uncertainty analysis. I therefore recommend major revision rather than rejection. If these methodological and positioning issues are addressed rigorously, the manuscript could become a strong contribution to JISA.

Dan saya cukup optimistis terhadap paper ini karena problem-nya memang berada tepat di area yang sudah dianggap penting oleh JISA: generalization, adaptability, heterogeneous networks, dan realistic NIDS evaluation. JISA sendiri telah menerbitkan studi yang menyoroti kegagalan inter-dataset generalization dan gap antara synthetic benchmark dengan real-world traffic.

Yang paling penting: saya tidak menyarankan Anda mengganti penelitian ini dengan model yang lebih rumit. Justru kekuatan paper Anda adalah diagnosis + semantic interoperability + low-cost adaptation + real traffic. Kita perlu memperkuat scientific proof dan positioning-nya, bukan membuatnya menjadi paper deep-learning lain.

Kalau target akhirnya benar-benar accept JISA, saya sarankan tahap berikutnya kita kerjakan "JISA Revision Plan v1", yaitu saya akan bedah paper baris demi baris/section demi section dan menentukan mana yang harus diubah, mana yang dipertahankan, mana yang harus ditambah eksperimennya, sampai menghasilkan daftar pekerjaan konkret sebelum versi English final.